# {{NAME_TITLE}} — What works

Append-only log of patterns/rituals/methods that *landed* with this user.
Generative Agents pattern: every entry is **importance-scored at moment of
capture**.

**Format per entry:**

```markdown
## <slug-readable-title>
\`\`\`yaml
importance: 1-10        # 1 = trivial, 10 = load-bearing
captured: YYYY-MM-DD
tags: [tag1, tag2]
\`\`\`

<2–5 lines of what actually worked, in concrete terms — what was tried,
what landed, what the user said.>
```

The dream pass uses `importance` for eviction protection (high = keep, low =
candidate for drop) and `tags` for cross-link discovery.

**Cross-link on write (A-MEM):** Before you append, scan this file for prior
entries that contradict or refine the new one. If found, edit them — add
`superseded_by: <new-slug>` to their frontmatter, or refine their content.
Never append blindly.

